use_offchain.description:
The instruction specifying whether it is allowed, needed, or forbidden to process the transaction off chain.

Values:
  * `never`—a transaction must be committed to the blockchain;
  * `optionally`—the resulting transaction will be processed off chain if it is a viable option for the given address and the current configuration state;
  * `required`—the request will be rejected if a withdrawal cannot be processed off chain.

ℹ️ Call `GET /wallet/crypto/check-offchain-available` to check if the given operation may be processed off chain.
